            "review_title": "Review at Chin Meshi",
            "review_text": "Tom W\nBallarat, Australia5 contributions\n0\nSo good!\nNov 2017 • Couples\nHighly recommend a visit to chin meshi, my wife and I sampled about 5 of the dishes (marinated cucumber, steamed gyoza, miso ramen, a dry noodle salad with some prawns and some really tasty mayo and inside out sushi with chilli pork) \n\nThose descriptions are not what’s written on the menu but you get the gist. Having been to japan myself last year and spending two weeks eating and drinking there chin meshi was a trip down memory lane.\n\nGo try it for yourself, so good!\nRead more\nWritten November 6, 2017\nrinkunc\nThank you for visiting our restaurant.\nWritten November 13, 2017\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
